## 1. Acquires script location to access scripts in
##    pwb_txscan.d.
## 2. If not given a file to open on the command line,
##    it presents a dialog of filenames from which to
##    pick a file to open.
## 3. Since work can be done, there is an option to
##    save the file.  It's not very clever: you can
